      "dim": [],
      "text": "At Gao, a centre of Songhai, Askia Mohamed built an earthen monument in 1495. Trans-Saharan salt and gold exchange helped sustain the empire’s wealth. The city anchors our final stop before the camera pulls back.",
      "sources": [
        "unesco-askia",
        "unesco-askia-periodic"
